Error [E0160]: `++` is not a Jet operator
  --> tests/ui/incr_retired_expression.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print(n++)
    |           ^^^
 Why: Jet updates a number with compound assignment only; an update hidden inside an expression reads one value and stores another
 Fix: Use `n` here, then write `n += 1` as its own statement after this line
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0160

Error [E0160]: `--` is not a Jet operator
  --> tests/ui/incr_retired_expression.jet:5:10
    |
  5 |     loop --lives > 0 {
    |          ^^^^^^^
 Why: Jet updates a number with compound assignment only; an update hidden inside an expression reads one value and stores another
 Fix: Write `lives -= 1` as its own statement before this line, then use `lives` here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0160

